*
* Lines that start with an asterisk, *, are comment lines and are ignored by PARAM
*
* Run a survey using the same reference data-set files as those used in "Simple parameter optimization.dat"
* and output the optimized reference data set files to folder "Updated reference geometries"
*
*  
* 
*                            Keywords used
*
*
* SET:        Define the sets of files that contains lists of compounds to be used.
* REF:        Define the folder that contain reference data for systems defined by SET. 
* ONLY:       Use only reference data-set systems where at least one parameter for each 
*               element present is marked for optimization
* NEW_REF:    The name of the folder where the optimized reference data set files are to be written to.
*
set="../sets/Stand-alone core.txt" &
ref="../../reference data/Data normal" &
external="Simple parameter optimization.rp" &
only &
new_ref="Updated reference geometries"
*
* Use the same set of parameters as were used in the job "Simple parameter optimization.dat"
*
 (H C N O)(All) 
end
